      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00250",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“对了，我想起来了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Oh, yes, I remember now.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00250",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "我在泰山南麓有一处房子，那房子和四周的田地，都算作我送你的礼物吧。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I have a house on the southern slopes of Mount Tai; take that house and the fields around it as my gift to you.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "rashomon-stories-p00250",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "你赶紧去住吧，这个时候，那房子四周应该开满桃花呢。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Hurry and go live there; by now, the area around that house should be full of peach blossoms.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
